# Copy to .dev.vars for `wrangler dev`. Never commit .dev.vars.
#
# Server-side Turnstile secret (a Worker secret in production:
# `wrangler secret put TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY`). When unset, create endpoints
# skip Turnstile verification and log a warning.
# Cloudflare's documented test secret that always passes:
TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=1x0000000000000000000000000000000AA

# PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY is NOT read from this file. It is inlined into the
# client bundle at build time from the build environment (shell env or .env):
#   PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=1x00000000000000000000AA bun run build
# (Cloudflare's documented always-pass test site key.) Unset = no widget.
